fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"analytics/GstAnalyticsModelInfo.html#gst_analytics_modelinfo_get_version","fragment":"\n\tgst_analytics_modelinfo_get_version\n\n\n\tGstAnalytics.ModelInfo.prototype.get_version\n\n\n\tGstAnalytics.ModelInfo.get_version\n\nRetrieve the version string of the modelinfo file format.\nThe version is in the format \"Major.Minor\" and is stored in the\n[modelinfo] section of the modelinfo file.\nParameters:\nInstance of GstAnalyticsModelInfo\nThe version string (e.g., \"1.0\").\nThe caller must free this with g_free when done.\nDefaults to \"1.0\" if not specified.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nRetrieve the version string of the modelinfo file format.\nThe version is in the format \"Major.Minor\" and is stored in the\n[modelinfo] section of the modelinfo file.\nParameters:\nInstance of GstAnalytics.ModelInfo\nThe version string (e.g., \"1.0\").\nThe caller must free this with GLib.prototype.free when done.\nDefaults to \"1.0\" if not specified.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nRetrieve the version string of the modelinfo file format.\nThe version is in the format \"Major.Minor\" and is stored in the\n[modelinfo] section of the modelinfo file.\nParameters:\nInstance of GstAnalytics.ModelInfo\nThe version string (e.g., \"1.0\").\nThe caller must free this with GLib.free when done.\nDefaults to \"1.0\" if not specified.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});